If necessary, existing regimes may need to be updated to reflect new technology. Recordkeeping and Reporting Requirements
1. Recordkeeping Article 12 of the Proposed Rules sets forth detailed and comprehensive recordkeeping obligations of covered providers. Specifically, these include:
• A duty to create event logs capable of enabling the automatic recording of events while the high-risk AI product or system is operating;
