Article 41 introduces the possibility to develop technical specifications out of the framework defined by the Regulation on standardisation (1025/2012). This new way of developing technical specifications is seen as a risk at various levels:
- having 2 different kinds of technical specifications would lack of clarity when the manufacturer does his risk analysis and tries to identify the appropriate specification;

